        "stale": false
      },
      "status": "interpreted",
      "text": "UnaMentis is a real-time bidirectional voice AI platform for extended educational conversations. The system centers on an iOS app with five main tabs (Learning, Chat, Assistant, History, More) that connects to a Python management server for session orchestration, curriculum delivery, and administrative functions. A Rust-based service manager (USM Core) handles process lifecycle and monitoring via WebSocket. The architecture spans Swift (iOS + Watch + macOS), Python (server + importers + Lambda), TypeScript (two Next.js web apps), and Rust (service management), with PostgreSQL for persistence."
    }
  },
